f living just steps away from stores and services.</span></p><p style=\"\"><span class=\"style-preset fjord-block-body\">•   On-site laundry<br/>•   Underground parking<br/>•   Gym on lower level<br/>•   Singles and couples preferred<br/>•   $700 per month plus heat. One year lease and references required.</span></p><p style=\"\"><span class=\"style-preset fjord-block-body\">Rental Office open daily 9 – 9.<br/>495 Colborne St 1632 523-2222</span></p></div><p style=\"\"> </p><h3 class=\"style-preset short-text-header\" style=\"\">C</h3><div class=\"style-preset box_black_border\"><p style=\"\"><span class=\"style-preset fjord-block-body\"><strong>WELL-KEPT</strong> 1- and 2-bedroom units in older high-rise building.</span></p><p style=\"\"><span class=\"style-preset fjord-block-body\">•   Very spacious units<br/>•   No pets<br/>•   Olympic-sized pool behind building<br/>•   Laundry on premises<br/>•   Gas heat<br/>•   On bus route</span></p><p style=\"\"><span class=\"style-preset fjord-block-body\">References needed. Ready for occupancy. Contact Z Group Realty 1632 521-4123 www.zgroup.com</span></p></div><p style=\"\"> </p><h3 class=\"style-preset short-text-header\" style=\"\">D</h3><div class=\"style-preset box_black_border\"><p style=\"\"><span class=\"style-preset fjord-block-body\"><strong>1092 WONDERLAND RD.</strong><br/>Now accepting applications for 1-, 2-, &amp; 3-bedroom units.</span></p><p style=\"\"><span class=\"style-preset fjord-block-body\">•   Prime location in the west<br/>•   Key-card entry<br/>•   Free indoor parking with 2yr lease<br/>•   Laundry facilities on-site<br/>•   En-suite bath</span></p><p style=\"\"><span class=\"style-preset fjord-block-body\">$725 incl. hydro. Heat extra. Call to view. Baseline Holdings 1632 525-7835</span></p></div><p style=\"\"> </p><h3 class=\"style-preset short-text-header\" style=\"\">E</h3><div class=\"style-preset box_black_border\"><p style=\"\"><span class=\"style-preset fjord-block-body\"><strong>GROUND FLOOR</strong> Two-bedroom units for rent.</span></p><p style=\"\"><span class=\"style-preset fjord-block-body\">•   Master bedroom with en-suite bath<br/>•   Enclosed patio at the back<br/>•   Alarm system<br/>•   Electric heat<br/>•   Parking at the front of each unit<br/>•   Washer/dryer in suite<br/>•   Bus at the door</span></p><p style=\"\"><span class=\"style-preset fjord-block-body\">Perfect for adult lifestyle. Rent includes membership to a nearby community centre with pool and fitness machines. $800 + heat &amp; hydro. Londor Realty 1632 776-9054 or www.linodours.com</span></p></div><p style=\"\"> </p><h3 class=\"style-preset short-text-header\" style=\"\">F</h3><div class=\"style-preset box_black_border\"><p style=\"\"><span class=\"style-preset fjord-block-body\"><strong>NEW HIGH RISE COMPLEX</strong> inviting applications. 1-, 2- &amp; 3-bedroom units.</span></p><p style=\"\"><span class=\"style-preset fjord-block-body\">•   Eat-in kitchen with dishwasher<br/>•   Panoramic views from living room<br/>•   Luxurious main bath with whirlpool tub<br/>•   2-vehicle underground parking<br/>•   Lower level has laundry and common room</span></p><p style=\"\"><span class=\"style-preset fjord-block-body\">$975 all inclusive<br/>View by appointment.<br/>Sentry Apts. 1632 503-9762</span></p></div><p style=\"\"> </p>\n    </itemBody>","responseDeclarations":[],"templateDeclarations":[],"version":"2.1","hasRubricsMarking":false,"customFields":[{"name":"Testing Focus level 1","value":["Reading"]}],"additionalResources":[],"mediaInfo":[],"presets":{},"sectionNumber":1,"questionNumberingInSection":"0","countingNumberingItem":false,"fixed":true,"orderNumber":2,"category":"stimulus","parentId":145595569},{"contentItemId":145593442,"contentRevisionId":145594138,"title":"  Matching Information GTR3","objectType":"content_question_qti2_match","supportedLanguages":["en_us"],"defaultLanguage":"en_us","itemBody":"<itemBody inspera:defaultLanguage=\"en_us\" inspera:supportedLanguag